    "plain": "New data from the small COSME germanium detector gave tighter limits on light dark matter particles than other experiments at the time.",
    "technical": "72.7 kg d (1998-1999) in an improved shield at 2450 m.w.e.: background about an order of magnitude below the earlier run; WIMP exclusion plots improving the bounds at low masses."
